          <h2 class="plate__pair">
          <span class="plate__word">Rig.</span>
          <span class="plate__word plate__word--accent">Lift.</span>
          <span class="plate__word">Land.</span>
          </h2>
          <div class="plate__story" data-reveal>
            <p>A heavy lift is planned on paper and proven in the air. Rigging, sling angles, the crane’s set-up, the receiving railcar or deck, and the tie-down that follows are each checked against the plan before and after the load leaves the ground. Nick attends heavy lift and project cargo operations and railcar loadings as an independent surveyor, and reports what was done, not what was intended.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="plate__meta">Crawler crane lifting a unit onto a railcar · AI-generated illustration based on a photograph from Nick’s files</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 5. Services -->
    <section class="section services" id="services">
      <div class="section__inner">
        <h2 class="section__title">Services</h2>
        <p class="section__lede" data-reveal>Every survey type Nick offers, and what you get from each one.</p>
        <ul class="services__list">
        <li class="services__item" data-reveal>
          <h3 class="services__name">Break bulk</h3>
          <p class="services__desc">Condition, count and securing of non-containerized cargo, recorded at loading or discharge.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="services__item" data-reveal>
          <h3 class="services__name">Heavy lift / project cargo</h3>
          <p class="services__desc">Attendance at lifts and moves of oversized units, checked against the rigging and stowage plan.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="services__item" data-reveal>
          <h3 class="services__name">Steel pipe / plate / coils</h3>
          <p class="services__desc">Tally, marks and condition of steel at each hand-over, with damage noted as found.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="services__item" data-reveal>
          <h3 class="services__name">Stock throughput warehouse inspections</h3>
          <p class="services__desc">Inspection of stored inventory and the facility holding it, for stock insured across storage and transit.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="services__item" data-reveal>
          <h3 class="services__name">Cargo claim surveys</h3>
          <p class="services__desc">The nature, apparent cause and extent of loss or damage, as observed on attendance and recorded for the claim file.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="services__item" data-reveal>
          <h3 class="services__name">CSC container inspections</h3>
          <p class="services__desc">Structural inspection of containers against the requirements of the International Convention for Safe Containers.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="services__item" data-reveal>
          <h3 class="services__name">Draft survey</h3>
          <p class="services__desc">Cargo quantity determined from the vessel’s drafts and displacement, at loading and at discharge.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="services__item" data-reveal>
          <h3 class="services__name">Towing survey</h3>
          <p class="services__desc">Inspection of the tow, the towing gear and the connections before the voyage begins.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="services__item" data-reveal>
          <h3 class="services__name">Loading / stowage surveys</h3>
          <p class="services__desc">Verification that cargo is stowed, blocked and lashed as planned, before the hold or the doors close.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="services__item" data-reveal>
          <h3 class="services__name">Railcar loading</h3>
          <p class="services__desc">Loading and securement of cargo on railcars, documented at the ramp.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="services__item" data-reveal>
          <h3 class="services__name">Truck loading</h3>
          <p class="services__desc">Loading and securement on trailers, documented before the truck leaves the yard.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="services__item" data-reveal>
          <h3 class="services__name">Jack and slide</h3>
          <p class="services__desc">Attendance at hydraulic jacking and skidding moves of heavy, tip-sensitive equipment.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="services__item" data-reveal>
          <h3 class="services__name">Airfreight</h3>
          <p class="services__desc">Condition and packing of air cargo, surveyed before build-up.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="services__item" data-reveal>
          <h3 class="services__name">Packing / crate surveys</h3>
          <p class="services__desc">Export packing and crating checked against the cargo and the route, before closure.</p>
        </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 6. Plate 04: cargo braced in a container -->
    <section class="plate" id="plate-drums" data-plate="04">
      <div class="plate__frame">
        <div class="plate__media">
          <video class="plate__video" data-video muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="assets/photos/poster-04-drums.jpg" aria-hidden="true">
